# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LandVision AI — environment variables
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in values. .env.local is gitignored
# and must NEVER be committed.
#
# RULE (spec §26): only PUBLIC, client-safe values may use the VITE_ prefix,
# because every VITE_-prefixed var is bundled into the browser build. Server
# secrets (service role key, Claude API key) must NOT be VITE_-prefixed and
# must never appear in client code, browser storage, or the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Public client-side keys (safe to ship to the browser) ---

# CARTO basemap API key.
# NOTE: VITE_-prefixed vars are bundled into the browser build, so this is a
# PUBLIC client-side credential, not a server secret. Restrict it to your
# allowed domains/origins in the CARTO dashboard where supported.
VITE_CARTO_API_KEY=

# Supabase project URL + ANON (publishable) key. The anon key is designed to be
# public and safe in the browser; access is still gated server-side by Row
# Level Security. Find both in Supabase: Project Settings -> API.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# --- SERVER-ONLY secrets — DO NOT prefix with VITE_, DO NOT commit ---
#
# Provide these to the SERVER runtime only (e.g. .dev.vars for local Wrangler,
# or your deployment platform's environment settings). They are listed here
# for documentation only; keep real values out of this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Supabase service role key — bypasses RLS. Server-side ingestion only.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# Claude API key — used ONLY by server-side code for the AI explanation layer.
# Use the rotated key; never a key previously pasted into any prompt or chat.
# CLAUDE_API_KEY=

# Allowed frontend CORS origins for ML FastAPI backend (comma-separated).
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,http://127.0.0.1:3000

# Government Portal Gateway Endpoint (Bhoomi Rashi / PARIVESH federated URL).
# GOVERNMENT_API_URL=https://bhoomirashi.gov.in/api/v1
